{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Sünen-i Ebu Davud","section":{"11":"The Rites of Hajj (Kitab Al-Manasik Wa'l-Hajj)"},"section_detail":{"11":{"hadithnumber_first":1721,"hadithnumber_last":2045,"arabicnumber_first":1721,"arabicnumber_last":2045,"name_native":"Hac Ayinleri (Kitab Al-Manasik Wa'l-Hajj)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1877,"arabicnumber":1877,"text":"İbn Abbâs'tan rivayet olunduğuna göre, Resulullah (S.A.V.) Veda Haccında deve üzerinde (ve Hacer-i Esved'in bulunduğu) rüknü bastonla selamlayarak (Beyt'i) tavaf etmiştir","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (1607) Sahih Muslim (1272)"}],"reference":{"book":11,"hadith":157}}]}